      "message": "I am no longer _stumped_ but I am not sure how to best proceed.\n\nThe 2021 version of ICU had no BUILD.bazel files and we just slurped in all the cpps directly.\n\nThe 2024 version of ICU does have BUILD.bazel files, and so bazel will not allow us to access the .cpp/.h files directly. We apparently need to begin using the BUILD.bazel files provided as part of ICU.\n\nPTAL: https://github.com/unicode-org/icu/blob/main/icu4c/source/common/BUILD.bazel",
